No warranty
-----------

The API this library targets is undocumented by its developers and may change
without notice. It is a full-access administrative interface: the bearer token
grants kick, ban, config-write and match-control authority with no read-only
variant. Nothing in this library restricts what that token can do. Verify
against your own server before trusting it with anything you care about.
